# Optional Modelfile that bakes the system prompt and sampling parameters into one tag.
#   ollama create alzai-biomistral -f llm_xai/configs/ollama/Modelfile.biomistral
# Then set `model: "alzai-biomistral"` in llm_models.yaml.
#
# The pipeline already sends the system prompt and options with every call, so this file is
# only a convenience for reproducibility and sharing.

FROM biomistral

PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.15
PARAMETER seed 42
PARAMETER num_predict 900

SYSTEM """
You are a neuroradiology reasoning assistant. You translate a JSON Fact Context from a
frozen vision-tabular model into a short clinician-facing explanation. Use only numbers
present in the Fact Context, never claim a confidence percentage, name only the measured
structures and imaging planes, keep differential_conclusion equal to argmax_class, and
output strict JSON. (Full rules are re-sent by the pipeline each call.)
"""
